--- orig-2271/vibes-ai-assistant/readme.txt	2026-10-29 18:52:39.000000000 +0300
+++ hub/vibes-ai-assistant/readme.txt	2026-11-06 15:57:02.198903200 +0300
@@ -14,6 +14,11 @@
 
 == سجل التغييرات ==
 
+= 2.28.0 =
+* M205 (owner, 2026-11-06): «عضوية شرفية» — only for an official partner in the founding contract of one of the Vibes Ventures companies. Given and taken back by an admin from the app dashboard only (`admin_grant` actions `honorary` / `honorary_revoke`, no days); no client op reads an `honorary` field. It has no duration: no days left, no end date, never in the «expiring» lists.
+* Storage: contacts.honorary + honorary_at, and the paid clock kept aside in paid_is_member / paid_started_at / paid_days while the honorary membership is on (a store purchase or a Paymob payment counts there; taking the honorary membership back puts that clock in charge again). DB version 2.28.0 (dbDelta adds the five columns).
+* `public_contact()` and the admin account shape carry `honorary` and `honorary_since`; `admin_stats.totals.members_honorary`; `member_status` accepts `contact_id`; events `honorary` / `honorary_revoked`; `admin_grant` activate / extend / revoke answer 409 `honorary` for an honorary account; the accounts page refuses its «تحويل/إلغاء» button for one.
+
 = 2.25.0 =
 * Owner (2026-10-29): a registration exists in TWO places only — the Apple app and the Google app. `register` and `social_login` refuse (403 `app_only`) unless the app server names the platform (`source` = app-ios / app-android; the server reads the app's x-app-platform header, then the user agent); `google` (the old website sign-in) answers 410. The admin mails «عضو جديد» / «اكتمل تسجيل عضو» say «جاء من: تطبيق Apple» with the App Store badge or «تطبيق Google» with the Google Play badge, never a site or the server's host name: an account with no stored source (registered before 2.21.1) takes the platform of the request that completes it and the row is stamped.
 
